 ["30651639"]}, "GEN": 1}}, "cp": [["", [], []], ["", [], []], ["", [], []], ["", [], []], ["", [], []], ["luminal vs regenerating surface endometrial epithelium", ["luminal endometrial epithelial cell", "regenerating surface endometrial epithelial cell"], "both sit at the endometrial surface and share LGR5 + WNT7A. Regenerating surface = KRT17 + SOX9 (+MMP7/ESR1, proliferative phase); differentiated luminal = LPAR3, PTGS1/COX1, KRT5, LCN2 (secretory phase)."], ["mucin-secreting vs luminal endometrial epithelium", ["luminal endometrial epithelial cell", "mucin-secreting endometrial epithelial cell"], "SAA1 is reported for both (Tan 2022 MUC5B+ population; Ulrich 2024 Epi-4). MUC5B + TFF3 (and PROM1/SIX1) are unique to the mucin-secreting population."], ["myometrial perivascular cell vs uterine smooth muscle cell", ["myometrial perivascular cell"], "PV MYH11 is named for MYH11, which the myometrial SMC Term also carries. SMC side: DES + CACNA1C. Perivascular side: MGP/MCAM/PDGFRB + vessel-adjacent location (Garcia-Alonso 2021 Visium)."], ["uterine vascular smooth muscle cell vs uterine perivascular / pericyte cell", ["vascular smooth muscle cell", "uterine perivascular / pericyte cell"], "NDUFA4L2 is expressed by both vascular SMC and pericytes. vSMC: ACTA2/MYH11 high; pericyte: RGS5 + PDGFRB high, MYH11 low."], ["innate lymphoid cell vs uterine natural killer cell", [], "IL7R (CD127) POSITIVE and NCAM1 (CD56) NEGATIVE = helper ILC; NCAM1+ ITGA1+ CD9+ and IL7R-negative = uterine NK. PMID 29457302 gates decidual ILCs as CD15-CD14-CD3-CD19-CD56-CD11b-CD127+; PMID 30429548 states dNK3 express CD160, KLRB1 and ITGAE 'but not the innate lymphocyte cell marker CD127 (also known as IL7R)'. NOT discriminative: NCR2/NKp44 (canonical NK activating receptor), TBX21 (NK also express T-bet), GATA3, KLRB1."], ["myofibroblast vs uterine smooth muscle cell", ["uterine perivascular / pericyte cell", "myometrial fibroblast"], "None found in the human uterus. Punzon-Jimenez 2024 (PMID 38296945) keys its myometrial 'myofibroblasts' on MYH11, DPP6 and KCNMA1 - but the same paper keys contractile SMC on KCNMA1/CACNA1C/CACNA1D, and MYH11 is this wing's SMC and perivascular marker (Ulrich 2024: MYH11 is highest in the PV subsets). Goad 2022 (PMID 36001050) defines Fibro-0 as myofibroblast-like precisely because it co-expresses SMC markers (CARMN, DES) with DCN. ACTA2/TAGLN/CNN1 are shared with SMC and pericytes (INV-3 trap)."], ["adventitial fibroblast vs myometrial fibroblast", ["endometrial basalis fibroblast", "myometrial fibroblast"], "They are the same population under two names. This wing's myometrial fibroblast is defined by PI16 + MFAP5 (table-grounded, PMID 38296945 Suppl Data 5); the global Concept 'adventitial fibroblast' (CELLMAN_CT:0000042, human_lung) is defined by MFAP5/SCARA5/PI16/DPT - the same axis. The distinct uterine fibroblast is the basalis one (C7, spatially validated in Ulrich 2024 and HECA), not an adventitial one."]], "oq": ["HUMAN_UTERUS:0000028", "HUMAN_UTERUS:0000026", "HUMAN_UTERUS:0000007", "HUMAN_UTERUS:0000018", "HUMAN_UTERUS:0000008", "HUMAN_UTERUS:0000031", "HUMAN_UTERUS:0000010", "HUMAN_UTERUS:0000037", "HUMAN_UTERUS:0000009", "HUMAN_UTERUS:0000017", "HUMAN_UTERUS:0000013", "HUMAN_UTERUS:0000003", "HUMAN_UTERUS:0000023", "HUMAN_UTERUS:0000024"], "ca": [{"name": "endometrial basalis-functionalis axis", "applies_to": ["fibroblast", "endometrial epithelial cell", "endometrial epithelial progenitor cell"], "poles": [{"pole": "basalis", "context_markers": ["C7", "IHH", "MMP26", "FOXA2"], "subtypes": {"fibroblast": "endometrial basalis fibroblast", "endometrial epithelial progenitor cell": "basal glandular endometrial epithelial cell"}}, {"pole": "functionalis", "context_markers": ["PAEP", "SCGB2A2", "GPX3", "PRL", "IGFBP1"], "subtypes": {"fibroblast": "endometrial stromal fibroblast (eSF)", "endometrial epithelial cell": "secretory glandular endometrial epithelial cell", "endometrial epithelial progenitor cell": "regene